meta {
  name: Get Continue Watching
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/watch-history?limit=10
  body: none
  auth: none
}

params:query {
  limit: 10
}

docs {
  # Get Continue Watching

  Retrieves the authenticated user's in-progress watch history (`completed = false` and `progressSeconds > 0`), ordered by most recently updated first (`updatedAt` descending).
  Requires authentication (`authMiddleware`).

  ## Query Parameters
  | Parameter | Type | Required | Default | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `limit` | `number` | No | `10` | Maximum number of items to return. |

  ## Responses
  - **200 OK**: Array of `watch_history` records.
  - **401 Unauthorized**: `{ "error": "Unauthorized" }`.
  - **500 Internal Server Error**: `{ "error": "<message>" }`.
}

